 741:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h ****  * 0-> normal function
 742:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h ****  * 1-> Alternate functionality(SCR pin,EVADC PDD,GETH RGMII/MII,HRPWM etc)
 743:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h ****  * Note:It is the Users responsibility to pass correct port, pin and mode inputs.
