 511:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Vmt/Std/IfxVmt.h **** 
 512:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Vmt/Std/IfxVmt.h **** /** \brief Returns TRUE if Auto-Initialisation is running for the given SRAM.
